      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The weight of your failures is crushing you, and that feeling of being a butcher is a heavy burden to carry. It sounds like the weight of your past decisions has completely hollowed out any sense of self or purpose you once held. Perhaps the silence after the fire is a quiet invitation to finally let go of the impossible standards you set for yourself. You deserve the space to find a different kind of peace away from this wreckage.",
