      "content": "The desire for the torment to end is a desperate cry, and it is understandable that you wish for the nightmare to cease. However, ending your life is not an act of accountability; it is a final surrender to the guilt. You deserve more than just the silence of an ending, even if you feel undeserving right now. Please, consider reaching out to someone who can help you carry this unbearable weight.",
